WHAT THIS SHOWS: scores are written on-chain through the guarded path; a peer can
move a DIFFERENT peer's score (Success, digests above), the node itself cannot
(code 4), and no single signer can move a score by more than 15 per minute
(codes 6 and 7) - a compromised peer's damage is bounded until it is revoked.
